     [2026-01-09] Implemented Parametric Cassette Baking and Reverted Worker Changes.
     Files changed: workers/nesting/core/main.py, server/api/batch/[id]/nest.post.js, server/api/cassettes/[id]/export.get.js, server/features/parametric-cassettes/*
